{"id":"8fa3940b26f1c35b2d99e96a3846c248752a08aecd2b133c5685bbf4b77f81ad","at":"2026-10-06T05:33:44Z","commit":"4e603ba081e9d6f23de3cbf3bf7b1bb3c60b1f82","parents":[],"op":"retire","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"ExTLA.Spec","hash":"df10c014"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/04-layer2-model-checker.md#Layer 2: Specification DSL + Model Checker/Overview","hash":"a3277a45"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"Declined (#352): the Overview names ExTLA.Spec as one of Layer 2's four components. The DSL has its own sections (Overview/DSL Macro Reference, Module: ExTLA.Spec.Compiled), which carry its implementation relations. The Overview's own claims are the three DSL rules, held by its verifies-tagged tests."}
{"id":"eeeab4271d92e3e85c7a8dc7d83e84fb20813895862fe7a57b8933e443cf77b7","at":"2026-10-06T05:33:50Z","commit":"4e603ba081e9d6f23de3cbf3bf7b1bb3c60b1f82","parents":[],"op":"retire","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"ExTLA.ModelChecker","hash":"bed18c77"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/04-layer2-model-checker.md#Layer 2: Specification DSL + Model Checker/Overview","hash":"a3277a45"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"Declined (#352): the Overview names ExTLA.ModelChecker as one of Layer 2's components. Its behaviour is specified, and related, under Module: ExTLA.ModelChecker and its API, State Graph, Safety and Liveness sections. The Overview's own claims are the three DSL rules, which the checker consumes but does not implement."}
